+                 no-limits form: 34 cells blank but for `-` at offset 16 — no lower or no upper
+                 limit (text rows, refused rows, an array without limits).
+mark             Cell 1: `▶` on the selected row, else space. Cell 2: `●` staged, else `◆` pending,
